        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Notice how many words end in *-hane* (Persian for \"house\"): *eczane* (medicine house), *postane* (post house), *hastane* (house of the sick), *kütüphane* (house of books — and *kütüp* is the Arabic plural of *kitap*). Once you see the pattern, four words become one."
        }
      ]
